  "notes": "AIR Communities: aircommunities.com/en/community.html rendered server-side with a full Colorado community directory including vanity marketing domains for every property (own_domain=true for all 23). No street addresses were shown on the directory page itself, so address is null for all AIR entries. Griffis Residential: griffisresidential.com has region pages at /communities/colorado/ (Denver & Front Range, 10 communities) and /communities/colorado-springs-colorado/ (1 community, Sagebrook) that rendered fine server-side; individual /property/<slug>/ pages provided street addresses. All Griffis community pages live on griffisresidential.com itself (no separate vanity domains found), so own_domain=false. Camden Property Trust: the JS-rendered camdenliving.com/apartments/denver-metro page returned an empty shell via WebFetch (no listings in initial HTML) -- confirms this operator's portfolio browse page is JS-only/blocked for scraping as warned. Individual community pages (e.g. camdenliving.com/apartments/denver-co/camden-rino) DID render with full address details, so the community list was assembled via targeted web search (site:camdenliving.com) plus direct fetch of each community page for address confirmation. Found 9 distinct CO communities (Denver, Golden, Englewood, Broomfield x2, Lone Tree, Highlands Ranch, Lakewood). One candidate, 'Camden Cherry Creek' (camdenliving.com/apartments/denver-co/cherry-creek), was investigated and determined to be a neighborhood-search landing page, not a distinct named community -- excluded to avoid a fabricated/duplicate entry. All Camden URLs are on camdenliving.com (operator's own domain), so own_domain=false for all. Cortland: apartments.cortland.com/co/denver only showed 4 of the operator's Denver-area communities (those with current availability); the full state directory at apartments.cortland.com/co rendered server-side and listed all 15 Colorado communities across Denver, Lakewood, Broomfield, Johnstown, Westminster, Thornton, and Colorado Springs. Each community sub-page (apartments.cortland.com/cortland-<slug>) provided a precise street address. No vanity marketing domains were found for any Cortland property -- all confirmed on cortland.com/apartments.cortland.com, so own_domain=false for all. One previously-search-surfaced listing, 'Cortland on Cherry Creek', was checked and found to 301-redirect to oaktrailatcherrycreeksouth.com, which is now an AIR Communities property (Oak Trail at Cherry Creek South) -- this property has evidently changed operators, so it was excluded from the Cortland list and is already captured once under AIR Communities. No vendor-hosted/blocked-domain (RentCafe/RealPage/Entrata/etc.) links were encountered for any operator in this batch; none of the hard-blocked domains were requested.",
